## Trigger

```
/stage0                           # interactive: capture profile + ask topic
/stage0 <topic>                   # use saved profile, fresh research on topic
/stage0 --kb-list                 # show all KB cases
/stage0 --resume <case_id> --replies <p>  # resume after pulse check
/stage0 --full <topic>            # EXPLORATION mode: output ALL industries (no limit)
/stage0 --breadth <topic>         # BREADTH mode: 10-12 category-level models (no instance research)
/stage0 --global <topic>          # Force global scope (skip Vietnam-specific queries)
/stage0 <topic> --teach           # TEACHING MODE: Socratic probes + real cases + insights
/stage0 <topic> --teach --batch   # Teaching content without interactive pauses
/stage0 <topic> --voice operator  # Mentor-style output: zero tables/bullets, conversational scripts
/stage0 <topic> --voice analyst   # Default report format (tables, scores, tags)
```

**Flag behaviors:**
- `--full`: Forces EXPLORATION mode + outputs ALL discovered industries (no "Top 5" limit)
- `--breadth`: Category-level scan (10-12 models). NO instance research. Fast. Use when exploring broadly before drilling deep.
- `--global`: Skip Vietnam/SEA-specific queries, scan global markets only
- `--full --global`: Both — maximum scope, all industries, all geographies
- `--teach`: Transforms Stage0 from analyst to mentor. Injects Socratic probes at Mountain Test, cites real Operator Experiences as case studies, generates cross-framework insights via Synthesis Engine. Interactive by default (pauses for user reflection).
- `--teach --batch`: Teaching content included but no interactive pauses (for autonomous runs)
- `--voice operator`: Transform verdict from analyst report to mentor-style guidance. Zero bullet lists, zero tables, zero technical headers. Write as mentor across coffee table. Scripts as dialogue. Numbers embedded naturally. Default: `analyst`
- `--voice analyst`: Explicit default — standard report format with tables, scores, tags

