### Step 2.6 — Query-intent classification (BLOCKING — Phase 1 bias-fix, Fix #1)

Classify the topic into one of 5 intent classes. Classifier output drives Step 3.5 Wave 1 addendum agents. Without this step, Wave 1 fires same 8 agents regardless of topic — producing operator-layer queries analyzed by white-hat researcher mix (root cause of 2026-04-13 bias).

```bash
