  "<topic>" > /tmp/stage0-intent-class-<case_id>.json
```

Parse the JSON output. 5 classes + unknown fallback:

| intent_class | meaning | Triggers |
|---|---|---|
| `marketplace_layer` | Platform rev-share, marketplace fees, SaaS economics | WAVE1_BASE only (no addendum) |
| `operator_layer` | Multi-account, farm, content-at-scale, VN/CN/MMO | +4 grey-hat/operator agents, FIRES forum preflight (Phase 2) |
| `jurisdiction_question` | Entity, banking, payments, tax, offshore | +4 opsec/tax/legal agents |
| `power_law_hunt` | "Hidden mountain", top-decile, P99, uncrowded | +4 archaeologist/Taleb/Naval agents, FIRES forum preflight |
| `grey_zone_adjacent` | KYC bypass, sockpuppet, fraud-adjacent | +1 ethics agent, FIRES fraud disclaimer (Phase 4) |
| `unknown` | No keyword match or confidence <0.35 | WAVE1_BASE only, no addendum |

**Key fields consumed by downstream steps:**
- `intent_class` → drives Step 3.5 WAVE1_ADDENDUM lookup
- `confidence` → feeds Step 6 deterministic confidence calc
- `addendum_agents` → list of agent names to spawn IN ADDITION to WAVE1_BASE
- `fires_forum_preflight` → gates Phase 2 forum-preflight hook (when implemented)
- `fires_fraud_disclaimer` → gates Phase 4 fraud disclaimer verdict section (when implemented)
- `matched_keywords` → audit trail, log to calibration on miss

